The Eminence in Shadow (Japanese: 陰の実力者になりたくて!, Hepburn: Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!) is
a Japanese light novel series written by Daisuke Aizawa and illustrated by Tōzai.

11
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:42,000
It began serialization online in May 2018 on the user-generated
novel publishing website Shōsetsuka ni Narō.

12
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:18,000
It was later acquired by Enterbrain, who have
published the series since November 2018.

13
00:46:48,000 --> 00:46:54,000
A manga adaptation with art by Anri Sakano has been serialized in Kadokawa
Shoten's seinen manga magazine Comp Ace since December 2018.

14
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
A spin-off manga by Seta U, titled Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!

15
