Shadow Gaiden (陰の実力者になりたくて！ しゃどーがいでん; "The Eminence in Shadow!

16
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:42,000
Shadow Side Story"), was also serialized via Comp
Ace from July 2019 to September 2023.

17
01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:18,000
