18
01:04:48,000 --> 01:04:54,000
Master of Garden: Shichikage Retsuden (陰の実力者になりたくて！マスターオブガーデン～七陰列伝～; "The Eminence in Shadow: Master of
Garden – Seven Shadows Chronicles"), started serialization via Comic Walker in May 2024.

19
01:08:24,000 --> 01:08:30,000
